=== ITEM 14 — "chore/dead-code-sweep-2026-09-07 is rewritten to feature/TEAM-4230-code-sweeper IN THE TICKET BODY" ===
Question posed: does ANY code path rewrite the ticket description/body (Jira or DDB)
under TICKET_PLAN_VALIDATOR=enforce, or only the dispatch context handed to the agent?

VERDICT: The ticket body/description is NEVER rewritten. In NO mode. The rewrite is
applied ONLY to the local prompt string handed to the agent. The dev notes
("context-only, no description write path") are ACCURATE; the ACCEPTANCE WORDING
("IN THE TICKET BODY") is NOT satisfied.

